            "review_title": "Review at SumoBBQ",
            "review_text": "Laurenaaleigh\nBrisbane, Australia121 contributions\n0\nExcellent food and fun atmosphere!\nOct 2015 • Friends\nWe met our business partners here for pur final dinner before we leave Hanoi.. Saturday night it was super busy but that did not mean the service or food quality suffered. The staff were very efficient brining out the drinks and also the food. They cooked it for us and were constantly dishing it up for us.. The food quality was incredible and the service was good! Really fun atmosphere and vibe! Defintely recommend!\nRead more\nWritten October 24, 2015",
